apsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What are the benefits of 100% Natural Jamun Honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Jamun Honey is naturally sweet and rich in flavor. It is a natural sweetener that pairs well with beverages, desserts, and savory recipes while maintaining its natural properties due to being unpasteurized.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_GmU3iF":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Why choose 100% Natural Jamun Honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>This honey is sourced from the nectar of Jamun trees in pristine regions. Its natural composition, free of additives and preservatives, makes it a premium choice for those seeking pure and unprocessed mono flora honey.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_C3NXWN":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How is 100% Natural Jamun Honey different from other honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Jamun Honey is unique due to its mono floral origin, derived specifically from Indian blackberry trees. This gives it a distinct, robust flavor compared to other varieties of Honey.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_9eQ6hg":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What is the shelf life of 100% Natural Jamun Honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>The honey has a shelf life of 12 months when stored properly in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_nFptDg":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":" How should 100% Natural Jamun Honey be stored?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Store Jamun Honey in a cool, dry place, away from heat and sunlight. It does not need refrigeration and may naturally crystallize over time, which can be reversed by gently warming it.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_cNCYkp":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is 100% Natural Jamun Honey raw or processed?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>This honey is 100% natural and unpasteurized, preserving its original enzymes, nutrients, and flavor while ensuring no additives or preservatives are included.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_UPqk4C":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":" How can I identify authentic 100% Natural Jamun Honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Check for purity indicators like unpasteurized labeling and a distinct, rich taste. Additionally, it should be free from additives and sourced from reputable suppliers.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_KBwYVk","collapsible_row_GJNCBB","collapsible_row_GmU3iF","collapsible_row_C3NXWN","collapsible_row_9eQ6hg","collapsible_row_nFptDg","collapsible_row_cNCYkp","collapsible_row_UPqk4C"],"custom_css":[".collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow {max-width: 80%;}"],"settings":{"caption":"","heading":"Q & A Section","heading_size":"h2","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"","container_color_scheme":"","open_first_collapsible_row":true,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"custom_liquid_LtUNqz":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<!-- Start of Judge.me code -->\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div style='clear:both'><\/div><div id='judgeme_product_reviews' class='jdgm-widget jdgm-review-widget' data-product-title='{{ product.title | escape }}' data-id='{{ product.id }}' data-auto-install='false'>{{ product.metafields.judgeme.widget }}<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- End of Judge.me code -->","color_scheme":"","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"video_RJejwG":{"type":"video","disabled":true,"custom_css":["@media screen and (min-width: 770px) {.video-section__media.deferred-media {max-width: 80%; margin: 0 auto; --ratio-percent: 45% !important; } .video-section__media video {max-width: 80%; height: auto !important; left: 0 !important; }}"],"settings":{"heading":"","heading_size":"h2","enable_video_looping":true,"video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/FtPbOQMjfZ4?feature=shared","description":"","full_width":true,"color_scheme":"scheme-26829669-9